WEBVTT

00:22.981 --> 00:24.190
Are you friends?

00:24.941 --> 00:27.402
Can you explain what happened again?

00:28.445 --> 00:30.530
So there's this kid, Oh Beom-seok.

00:31.031 --> 00:32.824
He goes to Byuksan High School.

00:32.907 --> 00:34.159
- Oh Beom-seok?
- Yes.

00:34.242 --> 00:36.411
He called me over to a café.

00:36.911 --> 00:38.079
He wasn't alone--

00:38.163 --> 00:39.164
Yeong-i.

00:41.499 --> 00:42.500
Are you okay?

00:45.795 --> 00:46.838
Are you okay?

00:46.921 --> 00:48.423
Where did the others go?

00:50.842 --> 00:52.052
I was alone.

00:54.596 --> 00:55.889
Young man.

00:55.972 --> 00:57.932
You can be honest with us.

00:58.558 --> 00:59.642
Don't worry.

01:01.978 --> 01:03.354
I was alone.

01:03.980 --> 01:05.148
What are you doing?

01:07.233 --> 01:08.401
Never tell Su-ho

01:09.903 --> 01:11.488
about what happened today.

01:12.238 --> 01:13.073
What?

01:16.576 --> 01:17.577
Hey, Si-eun!

01:21.664 --> 01:22.624
Si-eun!

02:07.919 --> 02:08.920
Beom-seok.

02:13.591 --> 02:14.425
Yeah.

02:15.844 --> 02:17.053
Stop this. Now.

02:19.681 --> 02:21.141
Leave Su-ho alone.

03:05.852 --> 03:10.982
WEAK HERO:
CLASS 1

04:03.993 --> 04:08.706
DIVIDING NUMBERS WITH TWO AND THREE DIGITS

04:08.790 --> 04:12.543
I'm just asking what you were doing
when he got hurt.

04:12.627 --> 04:13.836
Is that so wrong?

04:13.920 --> 04:15.588
You think you're the only one who's busy?

04:16.089 --> 04:19.759
Do you think I'm just resting at home
while you're working?

04:20.593 --> 04:22.762
You said that we'd do this together.

04:22.845 --> 04:24.597
That we'd raise him together!

04:24.681 --> 04:26.140
That we should have this child--

04:26.224 --> 04:28.059
I had no idea back then!

04:30.520 --> 04:33.356
I didn't expect him to get hurt
all the time like this.

04:42.365 --> 04:43.491
Si-eun.

04:44.075 --> 04:45.034
Si-eun.

04:48.162 --> 04:48.997
Si-eun.

04:49.580 --> 04:51.791
Si-eun, open the door and talk to me.

04:52.500 --> 04:55.086
Si-eun, please open the door.

04:56.796 --> 04:57.714
Si-eun.

04:58.256 --> 05:00.717
Si-eun, please talk to your dad.

05:02.802 --> 05:03.803
Yeon Si-eun.

05:04.804 --> 05:07.682
We weren't fighting. We were just talking.

05:07.765 --> 05:08.599
Si-eun.

05:10.685 --> 05:12.312
Si-eun. Yeon Si-eun.

05:12.937 --> 05:13.938
Si-eun.

05:16.899 --> 05:17.775
Si-eun.

05:27.952 --> 05:29.120
It's all right.

05:29.662 --> 05:30.830
Tell me the truth.

05:32.290 --> 05:34.542
Were these the same guys as before?

05:36.627 --> 05:37.670
It's the truth.

05:38.171 --> 05:39.672
I fell down some stairs.

05:40.548 --> 05:42.175
Be honest with me.

05:43.009 --> 05:44.385
Why were you there?

05:46.721 --> 05:47.555
No reason.

05:51.642 --> 05:53.394
You'll transfer schools.

05:54.437 --> 05:55.563
That's final.

05:55.646 --> 05:56.564
I don't want to.

05:57.065 --> 05:57.940
Seriously?

05:59.108 --> 06:00.485
What's wrong with you?

06:01.444 --> 06:02.945
I'm trying hard to raise you.

06:03.029 --> 06:04.280
Why won't you listen?

06:04.364 --> 06:05.281
Father.

06:09.118 --> 06:10.661
I've been wondering.

06:12.288 --> 06:14.832
Since when have you cared about me
so much?

06:16.751 --> 06:17.585
What?

06:25.635 --> 06:26.511
Never mind.

07:16.811 --> 07:17.645
Yes?

07:19.981 --> 07:21.357
Beom-seok is at home.

07:21.441 --> 07:22.608
How did it go?

07:22.692 --> 07:24.277
I handled the police at Seocho.

07:24.360 --> 07:27.155
I talked to his school principal.

07:28.448 --> 07:31.993
The assemblyman's wife is on Jeju Island,
so stay there and watch him.

07:32.076 --> 07:33.953
We don't know what he might do.

07:37.165 --> 07:39.709
Find a school in the Philippines.
They'll send him soon.

07:40.293 --> 07:41.127
Yes, sir.

07:44.714 --> 07:45.715
How did you know?

07:50.303 --> 07:51.304
From Mr. Park.

07:51.804 --> 07:53.431
He said you'd be in there.

07:54.974 --> 07:56.392
I meant about yesterday.

08:00.480 --> 08:01.898
The police contacted us.

08:03.232 --> 08:04.066
Yeon Si-eun…

08:05.276 --> 08:06.944
He just wanted to let it go.

08:07.445 --> 08:08.946
He said you were friends.

08:13.618 --> 08:15.995
What were the protestors' demands?

08:16.621 --> 08:17.497
It's important.

08:18.956 --> 08:19.999
Hey, wake him up.

08:21.542 --> 08:22.835
- Wake up!
- Su-ho.

08:23.794 --> 08:24.670
Ahn Su-ho.

08:25.588 --> 08:26.881
Where were we?

08:29.258 --> 08:30.718
No answer?

08:32.637 --> 08:34.055
Which page was it?

08:34.555 --> 08:36.933
Page 100. The Japan-Korea Treaty of 1876.

08:37.016 --> 08:38.351
I see. In that case…

08:40.561 --> 08:42.563
turn to page 109.

08:42.647 --> 08:45.274
Let's discuss
the Donghak Peasant Revolution.

08:46.567 --> 08:48.069
So, let's continue.

08:48.152 --> 08:52.114
In order for us to understand
the Donghak Peasant Revolution…

08:57.036 --> 08:59.163
AHN SU-HO

09:05.044 --> 09:08.798
SOMETHING CAME UP AT HOME
SO I CAN'T COME TO SCHOOL FOR A WHILE

09:13.135 --> 09:14.929
Why didn't you come home?

09:15.596 --> 09:16.889
You ignored my calls.

09:17.390 --> 09:18.224
What?

09:21.978 --> 09:25.606
Is this supposed to be a birthday prank?
Has it ended yet?

09:27.441 --> 09:30.027
Stop it. It's not funny.

09:31.821 --> 09:33.114
It's not a prank.

09:33.948 --> 09:35.324
I'm sorry about yesterday.

10:08.733 --> 10:11.068
FINAL EXAM
IN 1 DAY

10:11.152 --> 10:12.320
- Hey!
- God.

10:13.696 --> 10:14.572
Let's go smoke.

10:28.878 --> 10:30.129
Why isn't Beom-seok here?

10:32.840 --> 10:33.674
Not sure.

10:34.675 --> 10:35.926
Did you call him?

10:36.844 --> 10:38.054
Aren't you guys close?

10:38.929 --> 10:41.057
His phone was off. Do you know anything?

10:41.641 --> 10:43.601
Tell him to pay for my repairs.

10:43.684 --> 10:44.935
Yeah, okay.

10:49.065 --> 10:49.899
What?

10:51.776 --> 10:52.610
What repairs?

10:57.865 --> 10:59.325
It cost me 800,000 won.

11:01.410 --> 11:03.537
If you don't pay, I'll kill you all.

11:06.749 --> 11:07.583
Answer me.

11:09.210 --> 11:10.044
Okay.

11:14.423 --> 11:21.389
JEONG-CHAN

11:22.932 --> 11:24.183
The number you have called…

11:24.266 --> 11:26.227
Fuck, Beom-seok! Pick up the phone!

11:26.894 --> 11:29.563
Fuck, we need to take care of Su-ho.

11:30.189 --> 11:31.941
Hey, why isn't Si-eun at school?

11:32.900 --> 11:34.235
He didn't die, did he?

11:34.902 --> 11:36.904
- I mean, Yeong-bin fucking overreacted.
- Hey.

11:37.405 --> 11:39.156
You're the ones overreacting.

11:39.240 --> 11:42.368
If he were dead, we'd be at a funeral now.

11:43.411 --> 11:44.453
Shit.

12:09.854 --> 12:10.813
Wait!

12:12.732 --> 12:14.692
Beom-seok called you at first,

12:14.775 --> 12:17.528
but he took the girl instead
to draw you out

12:17.611 --> 12:18.988
because you didn't answer.

12:19.905 --> 12:20.740
What?

12:21.240 --> 12:22.116
You know.

12:22.616 --> 12:24.535
That girl who lives with you.

12:26.078 --> 12:28.122
But Si-eun showed up.

12:37.923 --> 12:39.467
- Keep going.
- Right. Okay.

12:39.550 --> 12:43.554
Beom-seok paid
one of Yeong-bin's friends to beat you up.

12:45.431 --> 12:47.808
Beom-seok did it all.
We were just bystanders.

13:08.621 --> 13:09.455
What is it?

13:11.999 --> 13:13.417
Which hospital is Si-eun in?

13:21.717 --> 13:22.718
He got out today.

13:25.971 --> 13:27.348
I'm sorry I caused this.

13:34.104 --> 13:34.980
Hey!

13:43.239 --> 13:45.407
Si-eun didn't want you to find out.

13:48.160 --> 13:49.411
Don't cause any trouble.

14:07.221 --> 14:08.055
Who is it?

14:10.599 --> 14:11.517
Delivery.

14:16.105 --> 14:17.481
What's up?

14:18.899 --> 14:20.150
Why are you asking?

14:20.651 --> 14:22.736
I'm thirsty. Give me some water.

14:38.127 --> 14:38.961
Hey.

14:40.713 --> 14:41.672
You doing okay?

14:44.842 --> 14:45.676
Yeah.

14:47.428 --> 14:48.512
What is it?

14:48.596 --> 14:49.430
Nothing.

14:49.513 --> 14:51.015
Just stopping by.

15:05.905 --> 15:06.739
Are you okay?

15:11.118 --> 15:11.952
What?

15:19.585 --> 15:21.795
Will you be at school for finals tomorrow?

15:25.132 --> 15:25.966
Yeah.

15:26.926 --> 15:27.760
I need to be.

15:29.178 --> 15:30.471
All right. Yeah.

15:32.181 --> 15:33.015
See you then.

16:37.746 --> 16:38.664
He's inside?

16:38.747 --> 16:39.581
Yes.

16:42.209 --> 16:43.877
Are you fucking crazy?

16:44.628 --> 16:46.505
You piece of shit!

16:47.506 --> 16:48.549
You.

16:48.632 --> 16:51.135
I told you not to fucking embarrass me.

16:51.885 --> 16:52.886
What's wrong?

16:52.970 --> 16:55.180
Hey! What's wrong with you?

16:55.764 --> 16:57.141
Fucking piece of shit.

16:57.224 --> 16:59.226
All you had to do was listen,

16:59.309 --> 17:01.228
do what you were told,

17:01.729 --> 17:03.272
and keep your head down.

17:03.772 --> 17:04.606
Was that hard?

17:05.107 --> 17:06.400
Was that so hard?

17:07.067 --> 17:07.985
Son of a bitch!

17:08.068 --> 17:10.487
You fucking idiot!

17:11.321 --> 17:13.574
You fucker!

17:14.450 --> 17:15.284
Hey.

17:16.535 --> 17:18.370
You're going to study abroad.

17:19.163 --> 17:22.750
Do whatever you want. I don't give a shit
if you kill yourself with drugs.

17:24.418 --> 17:26.712
Just don't tell anyone you're my son.

17:27.337 --> 17:28.589
Is that understood?

17:29.506 --> 17:30.340
Hey!

17:31.300 --> 17:32.760
Keep an eye on this punk.

17:39.892 --> 17:41.643
I never asked you to raise me.

18:02.247 --> 18:03.123
Beom-seok.

18:03.707 --> 18:05.334
Let go, fuck.

18:07.544 --> 18:08.420
I said let go.

18:16.345 --> 18:18.388
- Where to?
- Just drive.

18:41.578 --> 18:48.544
MISSED CALL: SU-HO, JEONG-CHAN
YEONG-BIN, TAE-HUN

18:48.627 --> 18:51.922
SU-HO
IMAGE

18:52.005 --> 18:54.716
ANSWER THE PHONE,
OR I WILL KILL YOUR FRIENDS

19:02.933 --> 19:04.059
Please, wait.

19:05.644 --> 19:06.603
So then,

19:08.188 --> 19:09.314
go get Beom-seok.

19:11.275 --> 19:13.443
I don't know where he is either.

19:13.527 --> 19:15.154
Honestly! I can't reach him!

19:22.369 --> 19:23.704
Then an eye for an eye.

19:39.720 --> 19:42.389
BEOM-SEOK

19:48.687 --> 19:49.563
Where are you?

19:56.653 --> 19:58.071
Where the fuck are you?

20:01.033 --> 20:01.867
Why?

20:03.327 --> 20:04.161
Oh Beom-seok.

20:06.371 --> 20:07.497
Stop hiding.

20:24.514 --> 20:26.266
Shit!

20:36.318 --> 20:40.572
OH BEOM-SEOK

20:45.827 --> 20:46.662
What's up?

20:52.000 --> 20:53.210
Let's get Ahn Su-ho.

20:55.128 --> 20:55.963
I'll pay.

21:26.368 --> 21:27.202
Hello?

21:28.495 --> 21:29.329
Hey.

21:30.831 --> 21:32.582
Have you talked to Su-ho?

21:35.085 --> 21:35.961
Yeah.

21:36.044 --> 21:37.671
He came by earlier.

21:39.381 --> 21:41.550
Su-ho knows everything that happened.

21:42.551 --> 21:43.385
What?

21:45.053 --> 21:47.556
He didn't come to work,
and I can't reach him.

21:50.267 --> 21:52.019
Did he say anything to you?

21:56.523 --> 21:57.566
He wouldn't

21:58.900 --> 22:00.610
go after Beom-seok, would he?

22:02.863 --> 22:04.281
I'll try to reach him.

22:26.511 --> 22:27.721
Are you making a movie?

22:30.015 --> 22:31.266
You're fucking crazy.

22:32.017 --> 22:32.934
What is this?

22:36.438 --> 22:37.522
Where's Beom-seok?

23:25.028 --> 23:26.071
Long time no see.

23:31.952 --> 23:33.995
You should have taken it out on me.

23:34.871 --> 23:36.289
Not on those kids.

23:38.417 --> 23:39.835
They did nothing wrong.

23:48.093 --> 23:49.219
I'm sorry.

23:54.599 --> 23:55.851
For upsetting you.

24:02.816 --> 24:04.025
I apologized.

24:06.987 --> 24:08.864
Now you apologize to Si-eun and Yeong-i.

24:12.451 --> 24:13.452
I don't want to.

24:15.370 --> 24:17.247
I have nothing to apologize for.

24:20.041 --> 24:21.042
Do it, please.

24:26.339 --> 24:27.591
I said no.

24:33.722 --> 24:34.890
Then I'll beat you up

24:36.600 --> 24:38.185
until you come to your senses.

24:44.858 --> 24:45.775
Hey, Ahn Su-ho.

24:53.658 --> 24:54.701
Get in the ring.

24:56.745 --> 24:58.663
You seriously paid this asshole

25:00.123 --> 25:01.374
just to beat me up?

25:06.129 --> 25:08.089
You're so fucking pathetic.

25:14.930 --> 25:16.848
One sec. Let me warm up.

25:39.329 --> 25:40.956
I guess you've been working out.

25:41.665 --> 25:43.416
You almost look like a pro.

25:43.500 --> 25:45.710
Did you forget
I once beat the hell out of you?

25:48.255 --> 25:49.089
Come on, then.

26:06.773 --> 26:07.816
Well!

26:07.899 --> 26:09.401
The time has come, guys.

26:09.484 --> 26:12.070
I told you I got owned
back in middle school,

26:12.153 --> 26:13.572
so this will be my revenge.

26:14.114 --> 26:16.116
This time, we'll fight
in an official match.

26:17.117 --> 26:18.034
Wish me luck.

26:22.581 --> 26:25.125
- This is it.
- Let's make it exciting.

26:25.208 --> 26:26.668
- Okay?
- Please.

26:26.751 --> 26:29.170
Please, Woo-yeong. You're our only hope.

26:29.254 --> 26:30.463
Cut the crap.

26:43.602 --> 26:45.312
Fuck, that was close!

26:50.233 --> 26:51.443
The old injury's there?

26:51.526 --> 26:53.528
So what if it is, punk?

27:02.329 --> 27:03.204
Behind you!

27:03.288 --> 27:05.332
- Woo-yeong!
- Go, Woo-yeong!

27:14.382 --> 27:16.134
Woo-yeong! Get your revenge!

27:17.552 --> 27:18.803
That's it!

27:18.887 --> 27:20.055
Good job!

27:27.771 --> 27:28.605
Feeling lucky?

27:28.688 --> 27:29.856
Fuck you, asshole.

27:35.236 --> 27:37.197
Kill that son of a bitch!

27:50.752 --> 27:51.878
You fucker!

27:51.961 --> 27:54.047
Hey, fuck you!

28:08.395 --> 28:09.813
Hey, he's fucked up.

28:11.064 --> 28:12.482
Fucker.

28:13.066 --> 28:14.109
Oh shit.

28:16.444 --> 28:18.530
- That fucker.
- That punk was tough.

28:30.750 --> 28:31.626
Hey.

28:32.794 --> 28:35.213
Now who's the pathetic one?

28:41.636 --> 28:42.887
Say it again.

28:47.976 --> 28:49.519
Who do you think you are?

28:50.145 --> 28:52.063
Always looking at me like that.

28:53.189 --> 28:54.149
Looking down on me.

28:55.900 --> 28:56.735
Hey.

28:59.654 --> 29:01.322
Please come to your senses.

29:06.870 --> 29:09.122
Stop blaming others, Beom-seok.

29:12.625 --> 29:13.460
Hey.

29:14.502 --> 29:17.338
Fuck you. Keep my name out of your mouth.

29:19.507 --> 29:21.593
Fucking bastard.

29:24.095 --> 29:25.597
Fuck, let's join in.

29:29.768 --> 29:30.685
- Fucker!
- Bastard!

29:30.769 --> 29:32.228
- You fucker!
- Son of a bitch!

29:34.689 --> 29:36.608
Son of a bitch!

29:41.196 --> 29:43.198
- Asshole!
- Motherfucker!

29:43.782 --> 29:45.450
Motherfucker! Son of a bitch!

29:45.533 --> 29:47.702
Son of a bitch!

30:02.383 --> 30:04.677
Fucking son of a bitch.

30:07.096 --> 30:07.931
Beom-seok.

30:10.517 --> 30:11.518
Oh Beom-seok!

30:17.232 --> 30:18.399
Oh fuck.

30:18.483 --> 30:19.692
Let's go.

30:23.154 --> 30:24.489
Don't touch me.

30:25.949 --> 30:26.783
Come on.

30:26.866 --> 30:27.992
Seriously, let go.

30:28.868 --> 30:31.496
I said let me go, fucking asshole!

30:40.588 --> 30:41.589
Hey, Ahn Su-ho.

30:49.138 --> 30:50.056
Ahn Su-ho.

30:56.980 --> 30:58.439
Hey, he isn't breathing.

30:58.523 --> 30:59.357
What?

31:06.281 --> 31:07.282
Hey, Ahn Su-ho!

31:12.287 --> 31:13.371
Oh fuck!

31:19.294 --> 31:21.296
You two were the last to hit him.

31:22.964 --> 31:24.507
If you leave now, it'll get worse.

31:25.884 --> 31:27.594
I'll fix this, so stay here.

32:06.466 --> 32:07.759
Su-ho.

32:13.890 --> 32:14.724
Su-ho.

32:18.978 --> 32:19.896
Su-ho.

32:23.983 --> 32:26.069
Su-ho, please look at me.

32:29.822 --> 32:30.740
Let's go.

32:32.533 --> 32:33.952
Stop. Come on.

32:35.411 --> 32:36.245
Beom-seok.

32:37.372 --> 32:38.748
Get him out of here!

32:39.332 --> 32:41.542
Su-ho isn't opening his eyes!

32:42.710 --> 32:43.711
Su-ho isn't…

32:50.468 --> 32:51.302
Wait!

32:51.386 --> 32:52.261
Wait, please.

33:00.937 --> 33:01.771
Si-eun!

33:02.981 --> 33:03.815
Where's Su-ho?

33:04.983 --> 33:06.275
He's not here.

33:08.194 --> 33:09.779
He won't answer my calls.

33:10.697 --> 33:12.115
Seriously, where is he?

36:17.133 --> 36:18.885
ALL NAMES, PLACES, AND EVENTS SHOWN
ARE FICTIONAL

36:18.968 --> 36:20.428
ANY SIMILARITY TO REALITY IS COINCIDENTAL

36:20.928 --> 36:24.265
Subtitle translation by: James Webb
